{
  "kanda": "sundara",
  "sarga": 29,
  "title": "Seetha experiences some good omens",
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.valmikiramayan.net/utf8/sundara/sarga29/sundarasans29.htm",
  "romanUrl": "https://www.valmikiramayan.net/utf8/sundara/sarga29/sundaraitrans29.htm",
  "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy",
  "introduction": [
    "Seetha experiences some good omens as follows; Her left eye, left shoulder and left thigh quivered, as also her clothing slipped a bit. Feeling these omens, her consciousness was awakened with exaltation."
  ],
  "closing": [
    "इत्यार्षे श्रीमद्रामायणे आदिकाव्ये सुन्दरकाण्डे एकोनत्रिंशः सर्गः",
    "Thus completes 29th Chapter of Sundara Kanda of the glorious Ramayana of Valmiki, the work of a sage and the oldest epic"
  ],
