      ],
      "devanagari": "तथा गताम् ताम् व्यथिताम् अनिन्दिताम् |\nव्यपेत हर्षाम् परिदीन मानसाम् |\nशुभाम् निमित्तानि शुभानि भेजिरे |\nनरम् श्रिया जुष्टम् इव उपजीविनः",
      "iast": "tathā gatām tām vyathitām aninditām |\nvyapeta harṣām paridīna mānasām |\nśubhām nimittāni śubhāni bhejire |\nnaram śriyā juṣṭam iva upajīvinaḥ",
      "translation": "To her who was in such circumstances, who was in distress, who was irraproachable, devoid of joy and dejected but virtuous, was bestowed with auspicious omens, as a prosperous man is bestowed with dependent servants.",
