      "devanagari": "भुजः च चार्व् अन्चित पीन वृत्तः |\nपर अर्ध्य काल अगुरु चन्दन अर्हः |\nअनुत्तमेन अध्युषितः प्रियेण |\nचिरेण वामः समवेपत आशु",
      "iast": "bhujaḥ ca cārv ancita pīna vṛttaḥ |\npara ardhya kāla aguru candana arhaḥ |\nanuttamena adhyuṣitaḥ priyeṇa |\ncireṇa vāmaḥ samavepata āśu",
      "translation": "Her left shoulder, which was pretty, distinguished beefy and round, which deserved to be applied with excellent black aloe and sandalwood paste, which had been used",
